+## Version 8.5.1
+
+Unreleased
+
+- Subcommand contexts look up their own entry in the parent's
+  `default_map` instead of inheriting the whole parent map, so nested
+  `default_map` values apply to subcommand parameters again.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
